  "description": "Main features\nARPG where you explore the area, defeat the boss, and aim for the next area.\n\nFind warpable checkpoints to make your adventure easier.\n\nYou'll be able to see through the enemy's actions, level up, get better equipment, and defeat the enemies that stand in your way!\n\nIf you feel that the battle is not going well, take a look at the situation.\nGuard, which completely prevents damage, activates when you're not doing anything.\nIt also activates while walking or dashing.\n\n[Those who might enjoy this game]\nThose who like hunting action and fighting game boss battles.\nThose who like to avoid or deal with attacks without using invincible moves.\nThose who like to observe and make predictions.",
  "description_short": "Monster named &quot;Meadowman&quot; appears in a peaceful and boring villages. What is the fate of Mischa, a villager who ends up fighting them?",
